    "type": "Table",
    "diagnosis": "",
    "title": "<p><strong>Box&nbsp;2.03</strong> Diagnostic criteria for <em>NF2</em>-related schwannomatosis</p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "",
    "copyright": "Adapted, with permission from Elsevier, from: Plotkin SR, Messiaen L, Legius E, et al. Updated diagnostic criteria and nomenclature for neurofibromatosis type 2 and schwannomatosis: An international consensus recommendation. Genet Med. 2022;24(9):1967&ndash;77. PMID:35674741",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 440.05pt; background: #DAEEF3; border-collapse: collapse; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" border=\"0\" width=\"587\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 440.05pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"587\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Diagnosis can be made when an individual has ONE of the following:</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 440.05pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"587\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">1. Bilateral vestibular schwannomas <strong>OR</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">2. An identical <em>NF2</em> pathogenic variant in at least two anatomically distinct <em>NF2</em>-related tumours <strong>OR</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">3. Two major criteria <strong>OR</strong> one major and two minor criteria</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 440.05pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"587\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Major criteria:</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 440.05pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"587\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">1. Unilateral vestibular schwannoma</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">2. First-degree relative other than sibling with neurofibromatosis type&nbsp;2</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">3. Two or more meningiomas</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">4. <em>NF2</em> pathogenic variant in an unaffected tissue</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 4; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 440.05pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"587\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Minor criteria:</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 5; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 440.05pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"587\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">1. Tumours (each counts as one): schwannoma, meningioma, ependymoma</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">2. Ophthalmological findings (each counts as one): bilateral cortical cataracts; retinal hamartomas, epiretinal membrane in a person &lt;&nbsp;40&nbsp;years</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>",
    "imageUrl": null,
    "thumbnail": null
  },
